# Google Cloud OAuth downloads. These arrive named `client_secret_<id>.apps.
# googleusercontent.com.json` and contain a live client secret — the exact
# filename you get by clicking "Download JSON" in the credentials console.
# Nothing here ever needs to be in the repo: the app reads GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID and
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET from the environment, and the file itself belongs in
# /srv/brewcult/secrets on the server (mode 600).
client_secret*.json
*credentials*.json
*.apps.googleusercontent.com.json
